    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sphirit</strong> is a tactical RPG with grid-based battles where masters summon mystical creatures known as Sphirits. Inspired by classic games, it blends strategy, customization, and a compelling journey through a world full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a new student at a school where Sphirits are part of everyday life, from training to competitions. With your team of unique creatures, you'll face rivals, uncover secrets, and fight to maintain the balance between elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, play skill cards, control the battlefield, and prove you're among the greatest Sphirit masters.</p>",
